@startuml
!include estilo.iuml
title ATLAS v.1.0 · Implantação no Windows e no Android

left to right direction

node "Computador Windows" as Windows {
  node "Processos Java 21" as Java {
    artifact "ATLAS Backend" as Backend
    artifact "Desktop JavaFX" as Desktop
    artifact "Terminal Bar JavaFX" as Bar
    artifact "Terminal Cozinha JavaFX" as Kitchen
  }
  node "Serviços portáteis" as Services {
    database "PostgreSQL\n127.0.0.1:55433" as DB
    queue "Mosquitto\n127.0.0.1:1883" as MQTT
  }
  node "Android Emulator\nAVD no mesmo computador" as Emulator {
    artifact "APK ATLAS Garçom · debug" as MobileDebug
  }
  artifact "Comprovantes simulados\n.local/comprovantes" as Receipts
  component "Fila de impressão do Windows" as Spool
}
node "Dispositivo Android físico\ninstalação em rede" as Physical {
  artifact "APK ATLAS Garçom" as Mobile
}
node "Impressora configurada" as Printer <<device>>

Desktop --> Backend : HTTP 8080
Bar --> Backend : HTTP 8080
Kitchen --> Backend : HTTP 8080
Desktop --> MQTT : MQTT 1883
Bar <--> MQTT : MQTT 1883
Kitchen <--> MQTT : MQTT 1883
Backend <--> MQTT : MQTT 1883
Backend --> DB : JDBC 55433
MobileDebug --> Backend : http://10.0.2.2:8080
MobileDebug <--> MQTT : tcp://10.0.2.2:1883
Mobile ..> Backend : HTTPS, conforme configuração de rede
Mobile ..> MQTT : MQTT sobre TLS, conforme configuração de rede
Kitchen ..> Receipts : simulado
Kitchen --> Spool : sistema
Spool --> Printer : driver instalado

note bottom of Services
  O modo portátil escuta em loopback.
  No Compose, a configuração padrão expõe PostgreSQL na porta 5432.
end note
@enduml
